### Create group discussion
POST{{host}}/discussions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "groupId": "4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b",
  "title": "Lets get the savings started",
  "body": "We really need to start saving hard guys. It is in the beginning of the year and we need to be sure of what to do with our lives"
}

#### Get group transactions
#GET{{host}}/transactions/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
#Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: {{customer_token}}
#
#### Get user'sgroup transactions
#GET{{host}}/transactions/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b/customer/054a080c-453e-44cc-8476-119e5f9765c6
#Content-Type: application/json
#Authorization: {{customer_token}}